1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,520
What had happened to the writer's bag?
作者的提包怎么了？

2
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:17,750
What had happened to the writer's bag?
作者的提包怎么了？

3
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:23,600
After I had had lunch at a village pub,
我在一家乡村小酒馆吃过午饭后，

4
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,800
I looked for my bag.
就找我的提包。

5
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:32,900
I had left it on a chair beside the door and now it wasn't there!
我曾把它放在门边的椅子上，可这会儿不见了！

6
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:38,700
As I was looking for it, the landlord came in.
当我正在寻找时，酒馆老板走了进来。

7
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:43,270
'Did you have a good meal?' he asked.
“您吃得好吗？”他问。

8
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,860
'Yes, thank you,' I answered,
“很好，谢谢，”我回答，

9
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:51,900
'but I can't pay the bill. I haven't got my bag.'
“但我付不了账，我的提包没有了。”

10
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:55,240
The landlord smiled
老板笑了笑，

11
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,580
and immediately went out.
马上走了出去。

12
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:02,530
In a few minutes he returned with my bag
一会儿工夫他拿着我的提包回来了，

13
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:04,230
and gave it back to me.
把它还给了我。

14
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,990
'I'm very sorry,' he said.
“实在抱歉，”他说。

15
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:11,680
'My dog had taken it into the garden.
“我的狗把它弄到花园里去了，

16
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:13,860
He often does this!'
他常干这种事！”
